## 十二、Internal Transactions / Token Transfers 页 ⚠️

````carousel
![Internal Transactions — 空状态](C:/Users/哈士奇总动员/.gemini/antigravity/brain/60558524-a1bc-4193-8e4e-79eb6b02e3ca/internal_txs_page_1772394160904.png)
````

### 改进建议

| # | 改进点 | 说明 |
|---|--------|------|
| 1 | **插画式空状态** | 所有空列表页统一设计：品牌色 SVG 图标 + 解释文字 + 引导按钮 |
| 2 | **解释什么是 Internal Tx** | 增加一行灰色小字："Internal transactions are created when a smart contract executes other contracts" |
| 3 | **关联索引进度** | 显示 "Indexing in progress (65%) — internal transactions will appear once complete" |

